---
// Grid of <Card>s inside a post: two columns, one on phones
---

<div class="cards"><slot /></div>

<style>
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
  margin: 30px 0;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
